          "author": "Adam Rubin, Contributions by Daniel Salmieri, Spanish Translation by Teresa Mlawer",
          "description": "Dragons love tacos. They love chicken tacos, beef tacos, great big tacos, and teeny tiny tacos. So if you want to lure a bunch of dragons to your party, you should definitely serve tacos. Buckets and buckets of tacos. \n\nUnfortunately, where there are tacos, there is also salsa. And if a dragon accidentally eats spicy salsa...oh, boy. You're in red-hot trouble.",
